ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhiwei and Xiaolan are planning a short trip, they are sitting on a park bench flipping through a travel guide. Mingda, although not invited to this short trip, still stands behind them listening to their discussion. Suddenly, Zhiwei notices Mingda on the side, and gives Xiaolan a glance. Then, Xiaolan sees Zhiwei's look, shakes her head, and continues to look down at the travel guide. Mingda sees this exchange of looks, and still stands in place.\n\n[Question]\nWhat do you think Mingda's mood is?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Mingda feels nervous, he thinks Zhiwei and Xiaolan dislike him standing behind and listening to the plan.\nB. Mingda does not care, he thinks the exchange between Zhiwei and Xiaolan has nothing to do with him directly.\nC. Mingda feels very annoyed, it seems that Xiaolan and Zhiwei do not want to invite him.\nD. Mingda feels excited, expecting they will invite him to travel together.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266743318070625,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e0e8d6006945d27fd968","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367720708,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:28:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"76496f044d634d329dc98d7b5bab2666"}